<title>USA: St Paul hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady.</p>
<p>Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs    59.00</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs    58.50-59.00</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs    57.50-58.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs    56.50-57.50</p>
<p>US 2-4     280-290 lbs    55.50-56.50</p>
<p>US 3-4     290-300 lbs    54.50-55.50</p>
<p>Sows: steady. Top 47.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-500 lbs   47.00-47.50</p>
<p>	     500-700 lbs   47.50</p>
</text>
